<title>USA: Kirkwood, Mo., won by George K. Baum.</title>
<headline>Kirkwood, Mo., won by George K. Baum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Co., said it won $3 million of Kirkwood, Mo., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.823 percent.</p>
</text>
